  "post_title": "Nueva campaña de Onda Centre Comercial “et puja a la Fira” en Pascua",
  "post_date": "2019-03-26 21:41:21",
  "post_name": "nueva-campana-de-onda-centre-comercial-%e2%80%9cet-puja-a-la-fira%e2%80%9d-en-pascua-2",
  "autor": "redaccion",
  "imagen_destacada_id": "NULL",
  "categorias": "Economía|Fiestas|Noticias",
  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/03/OCCetPortaAlaFira.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 680px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">(45 fotos de la feria de 2018) La Asociaci&oacute;n Onda Centre Comercial, en esta PASCUA 2019, va a continuar reservando a su clientela entradas para la feria de atracciones, al precio de 10 entradas/15&euro;.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">El &Uacute;LTIMO D&Iacute;A para reservar las entradas ser&aacute; el JUEVES 4 DE ABRIL. La feria estar&aacute; en funcionamiento del 12 al 28 de abril.&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2019/03/IMG_0354.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">Onda Centre Comercial agradece muy especialmente la colaboraci&oacute;n de la ASOCIACI&Oacute;N DE ATRACCIONES DE FERIA DE VILA-REAL.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"background-color: transparent; color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Arial; font-size: 14.66px; font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-decoration: none; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; word-spacing: 0px;\">La Asociaci&oacute;n tambi&eacute;n quiere agradecer el apoyo del Ayuntamiento de Onda, la Conselleria de Econom&iacute;a Sostenible, Sectores Productivos, Comercio y Trabajo, y la Caja Rural Nuestra Se&ntilde;ora de la Esperanza.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapasqua2018/img_0343.jpg\" alt=\"img_0343\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapasqua2018/img_0344.jpg\" alt=\"img_0344\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapasqua2018/img_0346.jpg\" alt=\"img_0346\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapasqua2018/img_0348.jpg\" alt=\"img_0348\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapasqua2018/img_0349.jpg\" alt=\"img_0349\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapasqua2018/img_0350.jpg\" alt=\"img_0350\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapasqua2018/img_0351.jpg\" alt=\"img_0351\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapasqua2018/img_0352.jpg\" alt=\"img_0352\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/firapasqua2018/img_0353.jpg\" alt=\"img_0353\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://p